  triage:title "AtmError::mailbox_write missing .with_recovery() on as_object_mut() failure" ;
  triage:description "inbox_message.rs line 368 — to_shared_inbox_value_with_policy() constructs AtmError::mailbox_write() on the as_object_mut() None path (ok_or_else closure, lines 365-372) without chaining .with_recovery(). This is a new S.8 function not yet present on integrate/phase-S. Required by project RBP policy: every AtmError constructor call must chain .with_recovery()." ;
